# Task 31: the uploaded model survives a reset. Captured 2026-10-20 15:10 on the HW-747 after model_test.py uploaded a 16,440-byte model: the board is reset through the USB RTS line and the console is read from the first boot line (model_test.py reopens the port 4 s after its reset, by which time this build has already loaded the model). Excerpt; the course port's start-up trace, Wi-Fi and broker lines are left out.
